# Per-VM cloud-init overlays go here. Layout:
#   cloudinit/overlays/<vm-name>/user-data.d.yaml      (additional cloud-config)
#   cloudinit/overlays/<vm-name>/meta-data.d.yaml      (additional meta-data)
#
# The merge contract is documented in vm/README.md. Keep overlays tiny —
# heavy provisioning belongs in the script being tested, not in cloud-init.
